              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "cmach"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This recipe looked like it made a lot so I cut it in half except I used extra pineapple, cilantro, and lime juice. It sat in the fridge overnight. I tried it in the afternoons and it was not good. The shallot over/ powered everything else- maybe my shallot was extra strong. I almost threw it out but decided to try on turkey tacos and enjoyed ut - I just added a bit of sour cream and lettuce.",
