              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "momof2"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Pretty good! I had gotten a bunch of apricots in a food share and wanted to use them. Not really an apricot fan, but gave this a shot and I am glad I did! Easy to make, and I’m thinking it will be better after sitting overnight. All real food. Served over chicken for dinner tonight, and may use as an actual salsa with chips at lunch tomorrow. Thanks for a nice fresh recipe!",
