              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "LOVESUBLIME"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was a refreshing change, but I have to say make sure your apricots are not too ripe or the salsa will become too mooshy/saucy. Also it tends to discolor a tiny bit overnight. I ended up increasing the pineapple and adding some chopped fresh jalapeno instead of habanero. The rest of the ingredients I added to taste.",
