            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "hollyf57"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My tree had an over abundance of apricots this year. I have a party to go to and thought this sounded tasty so I doubled the recipe. My husband couldn't get over the flavor and even later came in and said what a great taste it left in his mouth. I make lots of salsas and let's just say, half of the salsa I made for the party is staying home, I am not sharing. Can't wait to try on a pork tenderloin tomorrow for dinner.",
